# Git workflow

- Small steps; commit and push after each verified step (`bun run check` green, or the relevant sub-check).
- Push: `git -c credential.helper= -c 'credential.helper=!gh auth git-credential' push origin main`. No force push, no amend/rebase of pushed commits, do not change `~/.gitconfig`.
- Agent commits: `git -c user.name='Grok Designer' -c user.email=grokbot@users.noreply.github.com commit -m "…"`.
- New tool problems → one file in `.project/backlog/<tool>-<issue>.md` (context, repro, impact, proposed fix, status). Update `.project/STATUS.md` when a deliverable changes state.
